1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:03,166
have you ever eagerly waited for your Christmas cactus to bloom

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:05,000
as the holiday season approaches

3
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:07,666
only to find that year after year

4
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:09,400
the plant remains green and healthy

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,366
without a single flower bud appearing

6
00:00:12,966 --> 00:00:15,766
I know this can be disappointing for many plant lovers

7
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:18,466
but don't worry just yet because sometimes

8
00:00:18,466 --> 00:00:21,266
the plant simply needs proper care at the right time

9
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:23,400
to awaken its ability to flower

